      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The diagnosis of pulmonary endometriosis is difficult and requires a high index of suspicion in patients with pelvic endometriosis. We have reported a case in which a history of periscapular pain associated with menses proved useful in delineating the cause of the hemothorax."},
